flowchart TD
  Request["Request / question"]
  Brief["Research brief"]
  Source["Source record"]
  Finding["Finding"]
  Design["Design"]
  Decision["Decision"]
  Story["Bounded work item"]
  Implementation["Implementation / action"]
  Verification["Verification record"]
  Review["Review record"]
  Acceptance["Accepted outcome"]
  Reflection["Reflection / process change"]

  Request --> Brief
  Brief --> Source
  Source -->|supports| Finding
  Finding -->|informs| Design
  Design -->|proposes| Decision
  Decision -->|authorizes / constrains| Story
  Story -->|produces| Implementation
  Implementation -->|checked by| Verification
  Implementation -->|evaluated by| Review
  Verification --> Acceptance
  Review --> Acceptance
  Acceptance --> Reflection

  Finding -. new uncertainty .-> Brief
  Review -. requested change .-> Story
  Verification -. failure evidence .-> Story
  Reflection -. changes policy / method .-> Brief
